5,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! Trip time! I want to know how we're paying for things this year so it's fair for everyone. What should we check first?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree that clarity on costs is important. We should look into the total pricing options to avoid surprises later.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm looking forward to it! I'd like to understand how we spent our time last year to make sure we all feel comfortable this time.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I think we should prioritize the logistics of the journey. Efficiency is key to making the most of our limited time.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I just want it to be a nice trip. Maybe we should check the room and bathroom details?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, I want to see if we can get a big house! @Victoria, do you think all-in rates are better?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Generally, yes. All-in rates provide a predictable total, which is much more rational than paying for meals separately.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,That makes sense. I also wonder if the balance of shared and private time was the issue last year.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, that's a valid point. However, the travel time itself is often the biggest drain on our energy.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Midori. I think knowing about the time alone would be helpful.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to look into the money stuff! I want to see the all-in rates and the house prices!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I will investigate the all-in rates as well, and the pricing of offshore houses. I want a complete picture of the cost.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into how last year's days ran and the time alone in the shared-house year. I want us to be happy.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will check the ferry sailings and train time, as well as getting around by train and bus.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll check the bathing hours and bathroom provision. And the inn mealtimes and room arrangements.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
