35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found out that all-in rates mean everyone pays the same, even if some people eat way more than others! That's so fair!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"Actually, it can be unfair to those who eat less. However, it does provide the certainty of a fixed cost.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,I've been thinking about our dynamics. It seems that having a place where we can naturally drift apart for a bit is important.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The travel logistics for the valley are quite restrictive. The ferry and bus schedules would likely waste a significant amount of our time.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... the inn rooms are all shared futons. And the house bathrooms... some people said the water gets cold.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, but if we have a fixed price, nobody has to worry about who is paying for the extra side dish!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"That is true, but I am more concerned with the total sum. The offshore houses are quite expensive when you add meals.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, if the valley is too restrictive, maybe an urban area would give us more flexibility to breathe?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,Precisely. An urban center with frequent trains would eliminate the waiting and the rigid scheduling that exhausts us.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really like the idea of everyone sleeping in one room. It might be hard to... sleep.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,Let's do the all-in thing! It's like a magic box of food where you don't have to count coins!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I would prefer a fixed total for the whole week. If the offshore house is too variable, I'm hesitant.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,I think we should avoid a single shared house this year. Having a town around us would let us have both togetherness and space.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The urban option is the only one that doesn't sacrifice two full days to the schedule of a ferry or a rural bus.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I think... maybe the city is better. The rooms have doors. And the mealtimes aren't... fixed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
