60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I want the Island Trip! A big house sounds like a giant sleepover! And we can just pay one big fee!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,The Island Trip is too financially unpredictable. The City Break allows for a clear budget for accommodation and individual control over meals.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,I'm voting for the City Break. I think it's the best way to make sure we all feel connected without feeling crowded.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The Island Trip and the Hot Spring Town both involve too much waiting and rigid scheduling. The City Break is the most efficient.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think the City Break is best. I'd like to have a door and... not have to be at the table at a set time.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"Aww, but the city is boring! We can't do pranks in a hotel room! @Midori, please tell them the island is more fun!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"Fun is subjective, but financial stress is universal. The City Break is the most rational choice for our group's stability.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I love your energy, Sakura, but I think we'll actually enjoy each other more if we have a little space to miss one another.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,The time lost to travel is time we cannot recover. I cannot support an option that wastes two days on a ferry.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I really think the city is the safest choice for everyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"Fine! But if we go to the city, we have to find a really weird museum to visit! Deal?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I can agree to that, provided we set the accommodation budget in advance.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,That sounds like a wonderful compromise. A bit of adventure and a bit of balance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"As long as the transport is frequent and the schedule is flexible, I am satisfied.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm okay with that. A museum sounds... nice.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
